  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Considering Design Directions**\n\nI\'ve been exploring design recipes. Recipe 8, the \"Clean Utility\" approach, along with Recipe 11\'s \"SaaS Landing\" style, are great contenders. A combined 8/6 might also work for an \"Apple/Stripe inspired\" UI. My focus is leaning towards a light background, like `#fafafa` or white.\n\n\n**Defining Component Structure**\n\nI\'m structuring the components now, opting for file separation within `src/components/`. Key files include `AnimatedSection`, `Navbar`, `Hero`, and so on. `src/data.ts` will hold all content variables. I am going to build everything in typescript using `multi_edit_file`, creating all of these files, in order.\n\n\n"
