9</lines_modified>\n\t<edit_summary>Applied dark mode classes to AnimatedSection, filter buttons, motion.div, decorative background, tags, titles, role, description, icon container, and view details span.</edit_summary>\n</edited_file>\n<edited_file>\n\t<target_file>/src/components/Skills.tsx</target_file>\n\t<lines_modified>7:7;12:12;13:15;18:20;32:32;36:36;38:39;48:48;50:50;55:55</lines_modified>\n\t<edit_summary>Added dark mode classes to AnimatedSection, category div, category title, skill list item, achievements title, certifications title, and certification list item.</edit_summary>\n</edited_file>\n<edited_file>\n\t<target_file>/src/components/Contact.tsx</target_file>\n\t<lines_modified>7:7;8:8;10:11;15:17;19:20;24:24;25:25;30:30;31:31;36:36;37:37;45:45;49:49;53:53;57:57;60:60</lines_modified>\n\t<edit_summary>Applied dark mode classes to AnimatedSection, contact div, decorative elements, headings, paragraphs, contact links, form, input fields, textarea, and submit button.</edit_summary>\n</edited_file>\n<viewed_file>\n\t<absolute_path>/src/components/Layout.tsx</absolute_path>\n\t<lines_viewed>1-69</lines_viewed>\n\t<learnings>This file contains the Navbar and Footer components. It was modified to include theme switching logic and dark mode class toggling.</learnings>\n</viewed_file>\n<viewed_file>\n\t<absolute_path>/src/App.tsx</absolute_path>\n\t<lines_viewed>1-31</lines_viewed>\n\t<learnings>This file is the main application component. It was updated to wrap the entire app in the ThemeProvider and apply base dark mode classes to the main div.</learnings>\n</viewed_file>\n<viewed_file>\n\t<absolute_path>/src/index.css</absolute_path>\n\t<lines_viewed>1-21</lines_viewed>\n\t<learnings>This file was updated to import the Inter font, define a custom dark variant for Tailwind CSS, and set up smooth scrolling and base text styles.</learnings>\n</viewed_file>\n<viewed_file>\n\t<absolute_path>/src/context/ThemeContext.tsx</absolute_path>\n\t<lines_viewed>1-39</lines_viewed>\n\t<learnings>This new file establishes the ThemeContext, providing theme state and a toggle function. It handles reading from local storage and system preferences for initial theme setup.</learnings>\n</viewed_file>\n<viewed_file>\n\t<absolute_path>/src/components/AnimatedSection.tsx</absolute_path>\n\t<lines_viewed>1-41</lines_viewed>\n\t<learnings>This file contains reusable AnimatedSection and SectionHeading components. Dark mode classes were added to ensure consistent theming.</learnings>\n</viewed_file>\n<viewed_file>\n\t<absolute_path>/src/components/Hero.tsx</absolute_path>\n\t<lines_viewed>1-96</lines_viewed>\n\t<learnings>The Hero and About components were updated with dark mode classes to ensure their elements (backgrounds, text, buttons, spans) adapt correctly to the dark theme.</learnings>\n</viewed_file>\n<viewed_file>\n\t<absolute_path>/src/components/Services.tsx</absolute_path>\n\t<lines_viewed>1-44</lines_viewed>\n\t<learnings>The Services component was updated with dark mode classes for its container, cards, icons, titles, and descriptions to maintain a consistent look in dark mode.</learnings>\n</viewed_file>\n<viewed_file>\n\t<absolute_path>/src/components/Process.tsx</absolute_path>\n\t<lines_viewed>1-24</lines_viewed>\n\t<learnings>The Process component was updated with dark mode classes for its background and text to ensure it fits within the dark theme.</learnings>\n</viewed_file>\n<viewed_file>\n\t<absolute_path>/src/components/Projects.tsx</absolute_path>\n\t<lines_viewed>1-79</lines_viewed>\n\t<learnings>The Projects component was updated with dark mode classes for its container, filter buttons, project cards, tags, titles, role, description, and icon container.</learnings>\n</viewed_file>\n<viewed_file>\n\t<absolute_path>/src/components/Skills.tsx</absolute_path>\n\t<lines_viewed>1-65</lines_viewed>\n\t<learnings>The Skills component was updated with dark mode classes for its sections, category divs, achievement/certification titles, and the certification list.</learnings>\n</viewed_file>\n<viewed_file>\n\t<absolute_path>/src/components/Contact.tsx</absolute_path>\n\t<lines_viewed>1-70</lines_viewed>\n\t<learnings>The Contact component was updated with dark mode classes for its container, decorative elements, headings, contact info, form elements, and buttons.</learnings>\n</viewed_file>\n<viewed_code_item>\n\t<node_identifier>src/context/ThemeContext.tsx</node_identifier>\n\t<learnings>This file was created to manage the theme state (light/dark), provide a toggle function, and persist the user\'s preference using local storage. It also handles applying the `dark` class to the `document.documentElement` for Tailwind CSS to pick up.</learnings>\n</viewed_code_item>\n<viewed_code_item>\n\t<node_identifier>src/components/Layout.tsx (Navbar)</node_identifier>\n\t<learnings>The Navbar component was modified to import `useTheme` and `Moon`/`Sun` icons. It now includes a button that calls `toggleTheme` and conditionally renders the appropriate icon based on the current theme. Dark mode classes were also added to various elements within the header.</learnings>\n</viewed_code_item>\n<viewed_code_item>\n\t<node_identifier>src/App.tsx</node_identifier>\n\t<learnings>This file was updated to wrap the entire application in the `ThemeProvider` component. Additionally, dark mode classes were added to the main `div` to enable global dark mode styling.</learnings>\n</viewed_code_item>\n<viewed_code_item>\n\t<node_identifier>src/index.css</node_identifier>\n\t<learnings>This file was updated to import a custom Tailwind CSS variant for dark mode (`@custom-variant dark`) and to ensure the Inter font is loaded.</learnings>\n</viewed_code_item>"
