    user_requests: "Create a modern, high-end LIGHT THEME portfolio website for a Senior Visual & Web Designer with 13+ years of experience.\n\nThe website must feel premium, clean, and highly interactive with smooth animations, modern UI, and strong visual hierarchy. It should be fully responsive and optimized for GitHub Pages.\n\n---\n\n## \360\237\216\250 DESIGN STYLE\n\n* Light theme (white / soft grey background)\n* Subtle gradients (blue/green accents)\n* Clean, minimal, premium look (Apple / Stripe inspired)\n* Soft shadows, rounded cards\n* Smooth animations and micro-interactions\n* Elegant typography and spacing\n\n---\n\n## \342\232\241 PERFORMANCE\n\n* Fast loading\n* Lazy load images/videos\n* Minimal JS (use CSS animations where possible)\n* Optimized for GitHub Pages\n\n---\n\n## \360\237\214\220 HERO SECTION\n\nHeadline:\nSenior Visual & Web Designer Creating Powerful Digital Experiences\n\nSubtext:\nUI/UX \342\200\242 Branding \342\200\242 Social Media Design \342\200\242 Website Solutions \342\200\242 Hosting & Migration \342\200\242 Frontend Development\n\nDescription:\nI design and build high-performing digital experiences that help businesses stand out, engage users, and drive real results.\n\nButtons:\n\n* View My Work\n* Contact Me\n\nDesign:\n\n* Light background with soft animated gradient shapes\n* Smooth fade/slide animation\n* Clean bold typography\n\n---\n\n## \360\237\221\250\342\200\215\360\237\222\273 ABOUT SECTION\n\nTitle:\nA Designer Focused on Results, Not Just Visuals\n\nContent:\nI am a Senior Visual & Web Designer with 13+ years of experience delivering high-quality digital and visual solutions across multiple industries. My expertise includes UI/UX design, branding, social media design, motion graphics, frontend technologies, and complete website solutions.\n\nI have worked on multiple international projects, creating impactful websites, improving user experience, and building strong brand identities through creative and functional design.\n\nI specialize in delivering end-to-end digital solutions \342\200\224 from concept and design to development, hosting, migration, and ongoing optimization.\n\nClosing Line:\nDesign with purpose. Build with precision. Deliver results.\n\nAdd:\n\n* Fade-in animation\n* Optional counters\n\n---\n\n## \360\237\222\274 WHAT I DO (SERVICES)\n\nTitle:\nComplete Digital Solutions for Modern Businesses\n\nCreate modern cards with icons + hover effects:\n\n\360\237\216\250 UI/UX Design & Branding\nCreating intuitive, visually strong interfaces and brand identities that enhance user engagement and business presence.\n\n\360\237\223\242 Social Media & Marketing Design\nDesigning high-impact creatives, campaigns, banners, and promotional visuals that improve reach and engagement.\n\n\360\237\214\220 Website Design & Development\nBuilding responsive, high-performance websites with a strong focus on usability, speed, and scalability.\n\n\342\232\231\357\270\217 Website Management, Hosting & Migration\nEnsuring smooth and efficient website operations:\n\n* Hosting setup & configuration (Bluehost and others)\n* Domain and server management\n* Seamless website migration\n* Performance optimization\n* Ongoing maintenance\n\n\360\237\222\273 Frontend Development\nDeveloping clean, responsive layouts using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript for fast and user-friendly experiences.\n\n\360\237\216\254 Motion Graphics & Multimedia\nCreating engaging motion graphics, videos, and digital content for branding and marketing.\n\n---\n\n## \360\237\247\240 MY PROCESS\n\nTitle:\nHow I Turn Ideas into Reality\n\nSteps (visual timeline or step cards):\n\n1. Understanding business goals and user needs\n2. Planning structure and user flow\n3. Designing clean and modern UI\n4. Developing responsive and scalable solutions\n5. Optimizing performance and usability\n6. Delivering and supporting long-term growth\n\nAdd animation: step reveal or line animation\n\n---\n\n## \360\237\224\245 PROJECTS\n\nTitle:\nReal Projects. Real Impact.\n\nCreate a dynamic grid with hover + modal:\n\n\360\237\214\220 TopQore & Innovised Digital Platforms\nRole: Senior Visual & Web Designer\n\n* Designed and developed websites using modern CMS frameworks\n* Created branding, UI/UX, and social media creatives\n* Managed hosting, migrations, and maintenance\n* Delivered motion graphics, videos, and presentations\n* Collaborated with international clients\n\n\360\237\232\227 Star Cover Website\nRole: UI/UX Designer & Developer\n\n* Designed premium automotive UI with a luxury feel\n* Built responsive layouts\n* Enhanced brand presentation\n\n\360\237\237\241 De Voorwaarts Website\nRole: UI/UX Designer\n\n* Designed clean corporate UI\n* Maintained strong branding consistency\n\n\360\237\216\223 Acqua IX Platform\nRole: Visual Designer\n\n* Designed engaging and user-friendly learning interface\n* Improved usability and visual appeal\n\n\360\237\223\212 Accounting Website\nRole: Web Designer\n\n* Created conversion-focused UI\n* Designed professional and structured layout\n\n\360\237\222\252 Fitness Login UI\nRole: UI Designer\n\n* Designed clean interface with strong CTA\n* Focused on usability and clarity\n\n\360\237\220\276 Pet Website\nRole: UI Designer\n\n* Created friendly and engaging layout\n* Improved user experience\n\nFeatures:\n\n* Category filter (Web / Branding / UI / Video)\n* Hover animation\n* Click to open modal with details\n* Support images and videos\n\n---\n\n## \360\237\247\240 SKILLS\n\nTitle:\nSkills That Drive Results\n\n\360\237\216\250 Design & Branding\nPhotoshop \342\200\242 Illustrator \342\200\242 Figma \342\200\242 Adobe XD \342\200\242 CorelDRAW \342\200\242 Lightroom\n\n\360\237\214\220 Web & UI/UX\nWordPress \342\200\242 Elementor \342\200\242 Divi \342\200\242 WooCommerce \342\200\242 Shopify \342\200\242 UI Design \342\200\242 Website Maintenance\n\n\360\237\222\273 Frontend Development\nHTML \342\200\242 CSS \342\200\242 JavaScript (Basics)\n\n\360\237\216\254 Motion & Multimedia\nAfter Effects \342\200\242 Premiere Pro \342\200\242 Adobe Dimension \342\200\242 3ds Max \342\200\242 VFX \342\200\242 Motion Graphics\n\n\342\232\231\357\270\217 Tools & Platforms\nBluehost \342\200\242 Domain & Hosting Management \342\200\242 Website Migration \342\200\242 SCOM Monitoring \342\200\242 Basic Azure\n\nDisplay:\n\n* Clean grid or animated bars\n\n---\n\n## \360\237\217\206 ACHIEVEMENT\n\nTitle:\nRecognition & Awards\n\n\360\237\217\205 Appreciation Award for Client Satisfaction\nRecognized for consistently delivering high-quality design solutions and maintaining strong client relationships.\n\n---\n\n## \360\237\223\234 CERTIFICATIONS\n\nTitle:\nContinuous Learning & Growth\n\n* Diploma in Office Automation & Publishing \342\200\223 NBCE (95%)\n* Multimedia Specialization Certification \342\200\223 Wave Infotech\n* Diploma in Multimedia (Photoshop, Illustrator, Premiere Pro, After Effects, XD, 3D, VFX)\n* Azure AI Fundamentals (2024)\n* Microsoft Security, Compliance & Identity Fundamentals (2024)\n* SCOM Operations & Administration Certification\n\nDisplay as clean cards or timeline\n\n---\n\n## \360\237\223\236 CONTACT\n\nTitle:\nHave a Project in Mind? Let\342\200\231s Talk\n\nText:\nI am open to:\n\n* Remote roles\n* Freelance projects\n* Long-term collaborations\n\nDetails:\nEmail: [nanisnags@gmail.com](mailto:nanisnags@gmail.com)\nPhone: 8143197108\nLinkedIn: https://www.linkedin.com/in/n-nagesh-347976157\n\nInclude:\n\n* Modern contact form\n* CTA button\n\n---\n\n## \360\237\222\216 FOOTER\n\n\302\251 N Nagesh \342\200\224 Senior Visual & Web Designer\nDesigning experiences. Building solutions. Delivering results.\n\n---\n\n## \342\232\231\357\270\217 TECH REQUIREMENTS\n\n* HTML, CSS, JavaScript\n* Clean code structure\n* Files:\n  index.html\n  style.css\n  script.js\n* Ready for GitHub Pages\n\n---\n\n## \342\234\250 EXTRA FEATURES\n\n* Smooth scrolling\n* Sticky header\n* Section reveal animations\n* Hover effects\n* Video showcase support\n* Scroll progress indicator\n\n---\n\n## OUTPUT\n\nProvide complete working code with clean structure and comments.\n"
