    thinking: "**Finalizing The Implementation**\n\nI\'m wrapping up the dark mode implementation by adding the attributes to `Skills.tsx` and `Contact.tsx`. Specifically, I am focusing on incorporating the `dark:bg-zinc-950/50` class, and ensuring a smooth `transition-colors` effect for visual consistency. The objective is to finalize the project. I\'m almost there.\n\n\n**Refining Style Attributes**\n\nI\'m currently focused on refining the visual style attributes for various components. I\'m adding `dark:bg-zinc-900`, `rounded-[2rem]`, and border styles to further improve the dark mode appearance. Also adding and revising text color attributes for better readability, and incorporating shadows for enhanced visual depth. My goal is to achieve visual consistency and aesthetics.\n\n\n"
