    modified_response: "I have successfully added the **\"Branding & Logo Showcase\"** section per your layout request, restoring everything to perfect working order after the interruption! \n\nIt\'s currently located directly underneath the \"Projects\" section and sits just above the scrolling Tech Tools marquee. Here\'s what was implemented matching your layout specifications:\n\n- **Elegant Clean Grid Display**: Displays a clean, minimal 4-column responsive grid (collapses perfectly onto smaller screens) mapping through the logos.\n- **Micro-Interaction Hovers**: As requested, cards launch into an emerald/blue hue under-glow upon hovering, pulling the logo upward and sliding an intricate title and short description tag into view.\n- **Grayscale Filter Transitions:** Every logo is rendered in muted grayscale initially. Hovering instantly slides the logo outwards via `scale-105` and removes the grayscale unlocking full color.\n- **Full View Modal Popup**: Using `framer-motion` spring mechanics and the `AnimatePresence` state machine, clicking any branding logo scales open a beautiful blurry-backdrop popup carrying an isolated shot of the brand next to specific text definitions.\n- **Lazy Loaded Images**: Native `<img loading=\"lazy\" />` logic ensures all imagery won\'t block initial page paints. Since actual images were not provided yet in your prompt, I used placeholder structural IDs from `picsum` \342\200\224 simply replace the URLs contained within `/src/data.ts` under the new `branding: []` array with paths to your actual uploaded assets!"
