SECTION PLACEMENT\\n\\n* Add this section after the \\\"Projects\\\" section\\n* Maintain consistent layout and spacing with the rest of the site\\n\\n---\\n\\n## SECTION TITLE\\n\\nBranding & Logo Showcase\\n\\nSubtitle:\\nA collection of logo and brand identity work created for various industries.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## LAYOUT\\n\\n* Responsive grid (3\342\200\2235 columns depending on screen size)\\n* Clean spacing and alignment\\n* Light theme with soft shadows\\n\\n---\\n\\n## LOGO DISPLAY\\n\\nUse the uploaded logo images and display them inside elegant cards:\\n\\nEach card should:\\n\\n* Have white or subtle gradient background\\n* Rounded corners\\n* Soft shadow\\n\\n---\\n\\n## HOVER EFFECTS (IMPORTANT)\\n\\nOn hover:\\n\\n* Slight zoom-in effect on logo\\n* Card lifts upward (translateY)\\n* Add soft glow or gradient border\\n* Show overlay with:\\n<truncated 752 bytes>\"}\n{\"source\":\"USER_EXPLICIT\",\"type\":\"USER_INPUT\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-04-18T12:25:00Z\",\"content\":\"<USER_REQUEST>\\nThere was an unexpected error. Finish what you were doing.\\n</USER_REQUEST>\\n<ADDITIONAL_METADATA>\\nThe current local time is: 2026-04-18T05:25:00-07:00.\\n</ADDITIONAL_METADATA>\"}\n{\"step_index\":76,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-04-18T12:25:00Z\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"edit_file\",\"args\":{\"Instruction\":\"\\\"Add branding data array to siteData\\\"\",\"ReplacementContent\":\"\\\"export const siteData = {\\\\n  hero: {\\\\n    headline: \\\\\\\"Senior Visual & Web Designer Creating Powerful Digital Experiences\\\\\\\",\\\\n    subtext: \\\\\\\"UI/UX \342\200\242 Branding \342\200\242 Social Media Design \342\200\242 Website Solutions \342\200\242 Hosting & Migration \342\200\242 Frontend Development\\\\\\\"\\n<truncated 7143 bytes>\",\"TargetContent\":\"\\\"export const siteData = {\\\\n  hero: {\\\\n    headline: \\\\\\\"Senior Visual & Web Designer Creating Powerful Digital Experiences\\\\\\\",\\\\n    subtext: \\\\\\\"UI/UX \342\200\242 Branding \342\200\242 Social Media Design \342\200\242 Website Solutions \342\200\242 Hosting & Migration \342\200\242 Frontend Development\\\\\\\"\\n<truncated 6091 bytes>\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/src/data.ts\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Add branding data into site details\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Update data.ts\\\"\"}},{\"name\":\"create_file\",\"args\":{\"Content\":\"\\\"import { useState, useEffect } from \\\\\\\"react\\\\\\\";\\\\nimport { siteData } from \\\\\\\"../data\\\\\\\";\\\\nimport { motion, AnimatePresence } from \\\\\\\"motion/react\\\\\\\";\\\\nimport { AnimatedSection, SectionHeading } from \\\\\\\"./AnimatedSection\\\\\\\";\\\\nimport { X, ZoomIn } from \\\\\\\"lucide-re\\n<truncated 6581 bytes>\",\"Overwrite\":\"true\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/src/components/BrandingShowcase.tsx\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Create Branding Showcase and Logo Grid\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Create BrandingShowcase\\\"\"}},{\"name\":\"edit_file\",\"args\":{\"Instruction\":\"\\\"Insert Branding Showcase into main App layout\\\"\",\"ReplacementContent\":\"\\\"import { Navbar, Footer } from \\\\\\\"./components/Layout\\\\\\\";\\\\nimport { Hero, About } from \\\\\\\"./components/Hero\\\\\\\";\\\\nimport { Services } from \\\\\\\"./components/Services\\\\\\\";\\\\nimport { Process } from \\\\\\\"./components/Process\\\\\\\";\\\\nimport { Projects } from \\\\\\\"./components/Pr\\n<truncated 887 bytes>\",\"TargetContent\":\"\\\"import { Navbar, Footer } from \\\\\\\"./components/Layout\\\\\\\";\\\\nimport { Hero, About } from \\\\\\\"./components/Hero\\\\\\\";\\\\nimport { Services } from \\\\\\\"./components/Services\\\\\\\";\\\\nimport { Process } from \\\\\\\"./components/Process\\\\\\\";\\\\nimport { Projects } from \\\\\\\"./components/Pr\\n<truncated 786 bytes>\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/src/App.tsx\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Update App layout with Branding Showcase\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Update App.tsx\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":80,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-04-18T12:26:00Z\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"lint_applet\",\"args\":{\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Lint the updated project\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Run lint\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":82,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-04-18T12:26:09Z\",\"content\":\"I have successfully added the **\\\"Branding & Logo Showcase\\\"** section per your layout request, restoring everything to perfect working order after the interruption! \\n\\nIt\'s currently located directly underneath the \\\"Projects\\\" section and sits just above the scrolling Tech Tools marquee. Here\'s what was implemented matching your layout specifications:\\n\\n- **Elegant Clean Grid Display**: Displays a clean, minimal 4-column responsive grid (collapses perfectly onto smaller screens) mapping through the logos.\\n- **Micro-Interaction Hovers**: As requested, cards launch into an emerald/blue hue under-glow upon hovering, pulling the logo upward and sliding an intricate title and short description tag into view.\\n- **Grayscale Filter Transitions:** Every logo is rendered in muted grayscale initially. Hovering instantly slides the logo outwards via `scale-105` and removes the grayscale unlocking full color.\\n<truncated 617 bytes>\"}\n{\"source\":\"USER_EXPLICIT\",\"type\":\"USER_INPUT\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-04-18T12:36:47Z\",\"content\":\"<USER_REQUEST>\\nHow to add my original work logos at logo show case block ?\\n</USER_REQUEST>\\n<ADDITIONAL_METADATA>\\nThe current local time is: 2026-04-18T05:36:47-07:00.\\n</ADDITIONAL_METADATA>\"}\n{\"step_index\":84,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-04-18T12:36:47Z\",\"content\":\"To add your actual logo files to the showcase, you just need to upload the images to your project and update the data file. Here is exactly how to do it:\\n\\n### Step 1: Upload Your Logos\\n1. Open the **Files** panel on the left side of your AI Studio interface (the folder icon).\\n2. Look for the `public` folder. (If it doesn\'t exist, you can create it, or simply upload files to the root).\\n3. **Upload your logo images** (PNG, JPG, or SVG) into that `public` folder. \\n*(Hint: You can just drag and drop the files directly from your computer into the file explorer!)*\\n\\n### Step 2: Update the Image Paths\\nOnce your images are uploaded (for example, let\'s say you uploaded `aura-logo.png` and `nexis.svg` to the `public` folder), you will need to update the data file.\\n\\nGo to your `/src/data.ts` file, find the `branding` array, and change the `img` links from the default placeholder links to your new file names (starting with a `/`).\\n\\nHere is how it will look:\\n\\n```typescript\\n// Inside /src/data.ts\\n\\n  branding: [\\n    { \\n<truncated 690 bytes>\"}\n{\"source\":\"USER_EXPLICIT\",\"type\":\"USER_INPUT\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-04-18T12:40:55Z\",\"content\":\"<USER_REQUEST>\\n\\n</USER_REQUEST>\\n<ADDITIONAL_METADATA>\\nThe current local time is: 2026-04-18T05:40:55-07:00.\\n</ADDITIONAL_METADATA>\"}\n{\"source\":\"USER_EXPLICIT\",\"type\":\"FILE_CHANGE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-04-18T12:40:47Z\",\"content\":\"The USER performed the following action:\\nCreate file \\\\\\\\src\\\\images\\\\Asset 20.png\\nSuccessfully created empty file \\\\\\\\src\\\\images\\\\Asset 20.png\"}\n{\"source\":\"USER_EXPLICIT\",\"type\":\"FILE_CHANGE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-04-18T12:40:47Z\",\"content\":\"The USER performed the following action:\\nCreate file \\\\\\\\src\\\\images\\\\Asset 23.png\\nSuccessfully created empty file \\\\\\\\src\\\\images\\\\Asset 23.png\"}\n{\"source\":\"USER_EXPLICIT\",\"type\":\"FILE_CHANGE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-04-18T12:40:47Z\",\"content\":\"The USER performed the following action:\\nCre