    user_requests: "Modify the existing portfolio website code by adding a new section called \"Branding & Logo Showcase\".\n\nDo NOT recreate the full website. Only extend the existing structure and match the same design style, spacing, colors, and animations.\n\n---\n\n## SECTION PLACEMENT\n\n* Add this section after the \"Projects\" section\n* Maintain consistent layout and spacing with the rest of the site\n\n---\n\n## SECTION TITLE\n\nBranding & Logo Showcase\n\nSubtitle:\nA collection of logo and brand identity work created for various industries.\n\n---\n\n## LAYOUT\n\n* Responsive grid (3\342\200\2235 columns depending on screen size)\n* Clean spacing and alignment\n* Light theme with soft shadows\n\n---\n\n## LOGO DISPLAY\n\nUse the uploaded logo images and display them inside elegant cards:\n\nEach card should:\n\n* Have white or subtle gradient background\n* Rounded corners\n* Soft shadow\n\n---\n\n## HOVER EFFECTS (IMPORTANT)\n\nOn hover:\n\n* Slight zoom-in effect on logo\n* Card lifts upward (translateY)\n* Add soft glow or gradient border\n* Show overlay with:\n\n  * Logo name (if available)\n  * Optional: short description\n\n---\n\n## ADVANCED EFFECTS (LIGHTWEIGHT)\n\n* Convert logos to grayscale by default\n* On hover \342\206\222 transition to full color\n* Smooth transition (0.3s\342\200\2230.5s)\n\n---\n\n## ANIMATION\n\n* Fade-in on scroll\n* Staggered animation for each logo card\n\n---\n\n## OPTIONAL (IF POSSIBLE)\n\nOn click:\n\n* Open modal popup\n* Show larger logo preview\n* Add brand details (if available)\n\n---\n\n## PERFORMANCE\n\n* Use lazy loading for images\n* Optimize for fast loading\n* Avoid heavy animation libraries\n\n---\n\n## TECH\n\n* Update existing HTML, CSS, and JavaScript files\n* Keep code clean and modular\n\n---"
