  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Designing the Showcase**\n\nI\'m focusing on crafting a high-end implementation for showcasing WordPress websites effectively. My current priority is clean support for `siteData.projects` within `/src/data.ts`. I intend to update `/src/components/Projects.tsx`, specifically adding custom, optional fields to the project items in `/src/data.ts` to refine the showcase.\n\n\n**Adding Project Details**\n\nI\'ve refined the project data structure by incorporating new fields: `link`, `image`, and `platform`. I\'m also planning an interactive browser mockup for showcasing the websites! I\'ve been reviewing uploaded assets for potential project cover images, although most seem to be logos and branding elements. I have also noted we should add simulated links.\n\n\n**Implementing the Browser Mockup**\n\nI\'m now focused on the interactive browser mockup component. The plan is a Tailwind-built window, complete with search bars and control dots, to simulate a live website. I\'ll modify `/src/data.ts` to include `link` and `image` properties for projects. I\'ve begun tagging WordPress projects, like the example for TopQore, highlighting the CMS used. The aim is a polished, interactive showcase. I will also add the option to open the live site in a new tab or show a modal with a detailed desktop/mobile view.\n\n\n"
