  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Verifying Build Success**\n\nI\'m thrilled with the successful build! The clean code and smooth compilation with the added features are a significant win. Now, my focus shifts to meticulously verifying the completeness of the build. I\'m keen on ensuring every file is accounted for.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "To show off your WordPress creations in a premium, highly professional way, **I have completely redesigned the \"Projects\" section of your website!** \n\nSince a live website is best seen in action, your portfolio now showcases your WordPress work inside elegant, interactive **Safari/Chrome Browser Mockup Frames** that feel live, interactive, and beautifully integrated.\n\nHere is how we are now displaying your WordPress work:\n\n### 1. Interactive Web Browser Mockups \360\237\214\220\nEach project card now starts with a fully designed browser mockup window complete with standard window navigation dots (\360\237\224\264 \360\237\237\241 \360\237\237\242), a minimalist address bar, and a preview image of the website layout.\n- **Grayscale-to-Color Hover:** When a visitor hovers over the browser frame, it smoothly transitions from professional black & white into vibrant color.\n- **Live Glow Overlay:** Hovering over the window reveals an \"Explore Live Site\" tooltip with a clean slide-up animation.\n\n### 2. CMS & Page Builder Technology Badges \360\237\233\240\357\270\217\nTo make your technical WordPress expertise immediately obvious to clients and hiring managers, we added specialized platform tags to your project cards:\n- **`WordPress + Elementor Pro`** for *TopQore & Innovised Digital Platforms*\n- **`WordPress Custom Theme`** for *Star Cover Website*\n- **`WordPress + Divi Builder`** for *Pet Website*\n- **`WordPress + Custom Builder`** for *De Voorwaarts*\n\n### 3. Direct Live Anchors \360\237\224\227\nAt the bottom of each project card, we added a dedicated **\"Visit Live Website\"** link with a launching icon. Clicking this button opens the actual live WordPress sites you designed (such as `topqore.com` or `starcover.nl`) directly in a new browser tab. \n\n***\n\n### \360\237\222\241 How to Customize or Add More WordPress Work in the Future:\nTo update these links, adjust the descriptions, or load custom screenshot images in the browser frames:\n1. Open up `/src/data.ts`.\n2. Locate the `projects: []` array config.\n3. Simply change or add properties for your project items, like:\n   ```typescript\n   {\n     title: \"My New WordPress Site\",\n     role: \"WordPress Designer & Developer\",\n     tags: [\"Web\", \"UI/UX\"],\n     description: \"What you did on this website...\",\n     image: \"https://your-screenshot-url.com/image.jpg\", // Website image\n     platform: \"WordPress + Elementor Pro\",             // Tech badge\n     link: \"https://example.com\"                        // Live URL\n   }\n   ```"
    thinking_duration {
      nanos: 864990392
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
